<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: armor spike -->
  <UMW_ArmorSpike.label>徹甲スパイク</UMW_ArmorSpike.label>

  <!-- EN: The point is reinforced into a heavy armor-piercing spike that punches through plate and carapace. -->
  <UMW_ArmorSpike.description>先端は装甲を貫く重厚なスパイクとして補強されており,板金鎧も甲殻も打ち抜きます.</UMW_ArmorSpike.description>

  <!-- EN: lancing -->
  <UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.0>突き貫く</UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: armorbane -->
  <UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.1>装甲殺しの</UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: punching -->
  <UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.2>打ち抜く</UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: barbed -->
  <UMW_Barbed.label>返し付き</UMW_Barbed.label>

  <!-- EN: Barbs behind the point catch in the wound and tear it wider as the weapon is drawn back out. -->
  <UMW_Barbed.description>先端の後ろに付いた返しが傷口に引っかかり,武器を引き抜く際に傷をさらに大きく引き裂きます.</UMW_Barbed.description>

  <!-- EN: barbed -->
  <UMW_Barbed.traitAdjectives.0>返し付きの</UMW_Barbed.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: hooked -->
  <UMW_Barbed.traitAdjectives.1>鉤状の</UMW_Barbed.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: cruel -->
  <UMW_Barbed.traitAdjectives.2>残酷な</UMW_Barbed.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: bell-cast -->
  <UMW_BellCast.label>鐘鋳ヘッド</UMW_BellCast.label>

  <!-- EN: The head is cast solid like a bell. A clean strike rings a resonance through armor and bone, briefly stunning the target. -->
  <UMW_BellCast.description>ヘッドは鐘のように中実で鋳造されています.きれいに決まった一撃は装甲と骨に共鳴を響かせ,ターゲットを短時間スタンさせます.</UMW_BellCast.description>

  <!-- EN: bell-cast -->
  <UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.0>鐘鋳の</UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: ringing -->
  <UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.1>鳴り響く</UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: resonant -->
  <UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.2>共鳴する</UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: blood-stained -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.label>血染め</UMW_BloodStained.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon is caked in layers of dark, dried blood. The sight of it can send the people it wounds fleeing in panic, though carrying so grisly a thing weighs on all but the hardened. Traders will pay less for it. -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.description>この武器には黒ずんだ乾いた血が何層にも固まりついています.これで傷つけられた者は,その姿を見てパニックになり逃げ出すことがあります.ただし,これほど陰惨な物を持ち歩くのは,神経の太い者を除いて誰にとっても心の負担になります.貿易商は低い価格でこれを買い取ります.</UMW_BloodStained.description>

  <!-- EN: blood-stained -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.0>血染めの</UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: bloody -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.1>血まみれの</UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: gory -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.2>血塗られた</UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: sanguine -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.3>赤黒い</UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.3>


  <!-- EN: carbonized -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.label>炭化</UMW_Carbonized.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon has been through fire. Its charred surface is hardened by the heat, and what is already burnt does not easily burn again. The hardened surface hits harder than it should, but the scorched body is brittle and weathers badly. -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.description>この武器は炎をくぐり抜けています.焦げた表面は熱によって硬化しており,既に焼けたものは再び燃えにくくなっています.硬化した表面は見た目以上に強く打ち込めますが,焼け焦げた本体は脆く,風雨にも耐えられません.</UMW_Carbonized.description>

  <!-- EN: carbonized -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.0>炭化した</UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: fire-blackened -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.1>火で黒ずんだ</UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: charred -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.2>焦げた</UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: soot-stained -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.3>煤けた</UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.3>


  <!-- EN: counterweighted -->
  <UMW_Counterweighted.label>カウンターウェイト</UMW_Counterweighted.label>

  <!-- EN: A counterweight tames the heft, making the weapon quicker to recover between swings at a slight cost to power. -->
  <UMW_Counterweighted.description>カウンターウェイトが重さを抑え,威力をわずかに犠牲にする代わりに,振りと振りの間の立て直しが速くなります.</UMW_Counterweighted.description>

  <!-- EN: balanced -->
  <UMW_Counterweighted.traitAdjectives.0>均衡の取れた</UMW_Counterweighted.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: swift -->
  <UMW_Counterweighted.traitAdjectives.1>迅速な</UMW_Counterweighted.traitAdjectives.1>


  <!-- EN: cumbersome -->
  <UMW_Cumbersome.label>扱いにくい</UMW_Cumbersome.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon is bulky and overbuilt, slowing its swing. -->
  <UMW_Cumbersome.description>この武器はかさばり,作りが過剰なため,振りが遅くなります.</UMW_Cumbersome.description>

  <!-- EN: cumbersome -->
  <UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.0>扱いにくい</UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: bulky -->
  <UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.1>使いにくい</UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: ungainly -->
  <UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.2>無様な</UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: dead-blow -->
  <UMW_DeadBlow.label>無反発ヘッド</UMW_DeadBlow.label>

  <!-- EN: The hollow head is filled with loose shot that slams forward on impact, dumping the blow's full momentum into the target without a trace of rebound. Struck targets reel and stumble, even when the blow doesn't drop them. -->
  <UMW_DeadBlow.description>中空のヘッドには細かい粒が詰められており,衝撃の瞬間に前方へ押し寄せて,一撃の運動量をそのままターゲットに叩き込み,跳ね返りを一切残しません.打たれたターゲットは,その一撃で倒れなくてもよろめき,足をふらつかせます.</UMW_DeadBlow.description>

  <!-- EN: dead-blow -->
  <UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.0>無反発の</UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: shot-filled -->
  <UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.1>粒入りの</UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: battering -->
  <UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.2>打ち崩す</UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: enameled -->
  <UMW_Enameled.label>琺瑯仕上げ</UMW_Enameled.label>

  <!-- EN: A vitreous enamel has been fired and fused over the body of this weapon, glazing it in a deep, glossy violet. Traders will pay more for it. -->
  <UMW_Enameled.description>この武器の本体には,ガラス質の琺瑯が焼き付けられて融着しており,深く艶やかな紫の釉がかかっています.貿易商は高値でこれを買い取ります.</UMW_Enameled.description>

  <!-- EN: enameled -->
  <UMW_Enameled.traitAdjectives.0>琺瑯の</UMW_Enameled.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: glazed -->
  <UMW_Enameled.traitAdjectives.1>釉のかかった</UMW_Enameled.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: violet-sheened -->
  <UMW_Enameled.traitAdjectives.2>紫に輝く</UMW_Enameled.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: envenomed -->
  <UMW_Envenomed.label>毒塗り</UMW_Envenomed.label>

  <!-- EN: The point is coated in a slow neurotoxic venom which causes toxic buildup in those it wounds. -->
  <UMW_Envenomed.description>先端には効きの遅い神経毒が塗られており,傷つけた相手に毒物の蓄積を引き起こします.</UMW_Envenomed.description>

  <!-- EN: envenomed -->
  <UMW_Envenomed.traitAdjectives.0>毒を塗った</UMW_Envenomed.traitAdjectives.0>

