  <!-- EN: toxic -->
  <UMW_Envenomed.traitAdjectives.3>猛毒の</UMW_Envenomed.traitAdjectives.3>


  <!-- EN: flanged -->
  <UMW_Flanged.label>稜付きヘッド</UMW_Flanged.label>

  <!-- EN: Flanges ridge the head, concentrating the force of a blow into a narrow edge that cracks armor plate rather than merely denting it. -->
  <UMW_Flanged.description>ヘッドには稜が幾筋も立っており,打撃の力を狭い稜線に集中させて,装甲板を凹ませるだけでなく叩き割ります.</UMW_Flanged.description>

  <!-- EN: flanged -->
  <UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.0>稜付きの</UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: riving -->
  <UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.1>引き裂く</UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: armor-cracking -->
  <UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.2>装甲を砕く</UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: gold inlay -->
  <UMW_GoldInlay.label>金の象眼</UMW_GoldInlay.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon is inlaid with gold. Traders will pay more for it. -->
  <UMW_GoldInlay.description>この武器は金で装飾されています.貿易商は高値でこれを買い取ります.</UMW_GoldInlay.description>

