  <UMW_Lightweight.traitAdjectives.2>素早い</UMW_Lightweight.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: monomolecular -->
  <UMW_Monomolecular.label>単分子刃</UMW_Monomolecular.label>

  <!-- EN: The edge is honed to a single molecule and held there by a lattice of mechanites. It parts armor and bone as though they were not there. -->
  <UMW_Monomolecular.description>刃は単分子の厚さまで研ぎ上げられ,メカナイトの格子によってその状態が保たれています.装甲も骨も,まるで無いかのように切り分けます.</UMW_Monomolecular.description>

  <!-- EN: mono-edged -->
  <UMW_Monomolecular.traitAdjectives.0>単分子の</UMW_Monomolecular.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: crystalline -->
  <UMW_Monomolecular.traitAdjectives.1>クリスタルの</UMW_Monomolecular.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: honed -->
  <UMW_Monomolecular.traitAdjectives.2>研ぎ澄まされた</UMW_Monomolecular.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: needle point -->
  <UMW_NeedlePoint.label>針先</UMW_NeedlePoint.label>

  <!-- EN: Tapered to a fine needle, the point drives deep beneath bone and muscle, seeking the organs within. The slender point is harder to land cleanly. -->
  <UMW_NeedlePoint.description>細い針のように絞り込まれた先端は,骨と筋肉の下深くまで潜り込み,その奥の臓器を狙います.細い先端はきれいに当てるのが難しくなります.</UMW_NeedlePoint.description>

  <!-- EN: needle -->
  <UMW_NeedlePoint.traitAdjectives.0>針の</UMW_NeedlePoint.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: needling -->
  <UMW_NeedlePoint.traitAdjectives.1>針で刺すような</UMW_NeedlePoint.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: hypodermic -->
  <UMW_NeedlePoint.traitAdjectives.2>注射針のような</UMW_NeedlePoint.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: opiated -->
  <UMW_Opiated.label>アヘン塗布</UMW_Opiated.label>

  <!-- EN: The point is coated in a potent opiate that builds in the blood with each hit, eventually rendering the victim unconscious. -->
  <UMW_Opiated.description>先端には強力なアヘン系の薬物が塗られており,命中するたびに血中に蓄積し,やがて相手を昏睡させます.</UMW_Opiated.description>

  <!-- EN: opiated -->
  <UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.0>アヘンの</UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: sedative -->
  <UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.1>鎮静の</UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: soporific -->
  <UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.2>催眠の</UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: numbing -->
  <UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.3>麻痺させる</UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.3>


  <!-- EN: ornamental -->
  <UMW_Ornamental.label>装飾的</UMW_Ornamental.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon was crafted for aesthetics over functionality. It deals less damage but looks great. -->
  <UMW_Ornamental.description>この武器は実用性よりも美観を重視して作られています.与えるダメージは減りますが,見た目は素晴らしいです.</UMW_Ornamental.description>

  <!-- EN: beautiful -->
  <UMW_Ornamental.traitAdjectives.0>美しい</UMW_Ornamental.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: elegant -->
  <UMW_Ornamental.traitAdjectives.1>優美な</UMW_Ornamental.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: ornamental -->
  <UMW_Ornamental.traitAdjectives.2>おしゃれな</UMW_Ornamental.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: piledriver -->
  <UMW_Piledriver.label>杭打ちヘッド</UMW_Piledriver.label>

  <!-- EN: The head is built as a piledriver. On command the weapon's full mass can be slammed into the ground, sending a stunning shockwave out through the earth. The shock is indiscriminate; it stuns friend and foe alike, though the braced wielder is spared. Once used, the mechanism takes time to reset. -->
  <UMW_Piledriver.description>ヘッドは杭打ち機として作られています.使用者の合図で武器の全質量を地面に叩き込み,大地を伝わってスタンさせる衝撃波を送り出せます.この衝撃は敵味方を区別せず,味方も敵も同様にスタンさせますが,身構えている使用者だけは影響を受けません.一度使うと,機構が元に戻るまで時間がかかります.</UMW_Piledriver.description>

  <!-- EN: piledriving -->
  <UMW_Piledriver.traitAdjectives.0>杭打ちの</UMW_Piledriver.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: earthshaking -->
  <UMW_Piledriver.traitAdjectives.1>地を揺るがす</UMW_Piledriver.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: quaking -->
  <UMW_Piledriver.traitAdjectives.2>震わせる</UMW_Piledriver.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: thunderous -->
  <UMW_Piledriver.traitAdjectives.3>雷鳴の</UMW_Piledriver.traitAdjectives.3>


  <!-- EN: plasma-cored -->
  <UMW_PlasmaCored.label>プラズマコア</UMW_PlasmaCored.label>

  <!-- EN: The core of the blade channels a sheath of plasma, held in place by an energy field and released into the wounds it cuts. It sears flesh and sometimes ignites the target. -->
  <UMW_PlasmaCored.description>刃のコアはプラズマの鞘を導き,エネルギー場によってその場に保持し,切り開いた傷口へと解き放ちます.プラズマは肉を焼き焦がし,ときにはターゲットを発火させます.</UMW_PlasmaCored.description>

  <!-- EN: plasma-cored -->
  <UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.0>プラズマの</UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: burning -->
  <UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.1>燃える</UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: searing -->
  <UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.2>灼熱の</UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: fiery -->
  <UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.3>火の</UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.3>

  <!-- EN: incandescent -->
  <UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.4>白熱の</UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.4>


  <!-- EN: quilloned -->
  <UMW_Quilloned.label>十字鍔</UMW_Quilloned.label>

  <!-- EN: Quillons flare wide from the hilt, letting the wielder catch incoming blows and turn them aside. -->
  <UMW_Quilloned.description>鍔が柄から左右へ大きく張り出しており,使用者は迫る攻撃を受け止めて受け流すことができます.</UMW_Quilloned.description>

  <!-- EN: quilloned -->
  <UMW_Quilloned.traitAdjectives.0>鍔付きの</UMW_Quilloned.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: cross-guarded -->
  <UMW_Quilloned.traitAdjectives.1>十字鍔の</UMW_Quilloned.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: warding -->
  <UMW_Quilloned.traitAdjectives.2>守りの</UMW_Quilloned.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: razored -->
  <UMW_Razored.label>剃刀刃</UMW_Razored.label>

  <!-- EN: The edge is honed to a keen razor that bites deeper and drives cleanly through armor. -->
  <UMW_Razored.description>刃は剃刀のように鋭く研ぎ上げられており,より深く食い込み,装甲もきれいに貫きます.</UMW_Razored.description>

  <!-- EN: razored -->
