  <!-- EN: keen -->
  <UMW_Razored.traitAdjectives.2>鋭利な</UMW_Razored.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: serrated -->
  <UMW_Serrated.label>鋸歯刃</UMW_Serrated.label>

  <!-- EN: The edge is cut into vicious teeth that tear ragged, freely bleeding wounds, though they slash a little shallower than a clean edge. On a thrust the same teeth catch and rip flesh as the blade is drawn back. -->
  <UMW_Serrated.description>刃には凶悪な歯が刻まれており,ぎざぎざに裂けて血が止まらない傷を作りますが,平らな刃に比べると斬り込みはやや浅くなります.突いたときにも同じ歯が引っかかり,刃を引き抜く際に肉を引き裂きます.</UMW_Serrated.description>

  <!-- EN: serrated -->
  <UMW_Serrated.traitAdjectives.0>鋸歯の</UMW_Serrated.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: jagged -->
  <UMW_Serrated.traitAdjectives.1>ぎざぎざの</UMW_Serrated.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: vicious -->
  <UMW_Serrated.traitAdjectives.2>凶悪な</UMW_Serrated.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: sawtooth -->
  <UMW_Serrated.traitAdjectives.3>鋸刃の</UMW_Serrated.traitAdjectives.3>


  <!-- EN: storied -->
  <UMW_Storied.label>由緒ある</UMW_Storied.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon carries a recorded lineage of named bearers and remembered deeds. The wielder can raise it high in a rallying cry; allies who see it are steeled, and for a time wounds barely slow them. Such a moment can only be called upon once every few days. -->
  <UMW_Storied.description>この武器には,名を持つ歴代の持ち主と語り継がれる武勲が記録として刻まれています.使用者はこれを高く掲げて鼓舞の叫びを上げることができ,それを目にした味方は気を引き締め,しばらくの間は傷を負ってもほとんど動きが鈍りません.この瞬間は数日に一度しか呼び起こせません.</UMW_Storied.description>

  <!-- EN: storied -->
  <UMW_Storied.traitAdjectives.0>由緒ある</UMW_Storied.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: fabled -->
  <UMW_Storied.traitAdjectives.1>伝説の</UMW_Storied.traitAdjectives.1>

